    "title": "Maumelle football coach Brian Maupin steps down from position - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brandon Ringo ,\n1 days ago MAUMELLE, Ark. – After four seasons on the sidelines with the Maumelle Hornets, head coach Brian Maupin announced Monday that he will be stepping down from the program. In a post on social media, Maupin said that after a lot of prayer and talks with his family, he’s made the decision to move on from the school. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
